// expect-exit: 70
// The AOT backend must fail a runtime error exactly like the VM: the same exit
// code (70), with no recovery. `chr` of a surrogate is the fixture because it
// is a pure check with no host dependency, so the binary reaches the failure
// through the ordinary builtin path. `tests/aot_runtime_error.cmake` builds it
// and checks the generated binary; this file also runs on the VM directly.
print("before");
print(chr(0xD800));
print("after");
